<title>MEXICO: RESEARCH ALERT-Autrey upgraded to buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Autrey upgraded to buy.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>ING Barings upgraded retail stock Grupo Casa Autrey to buy from hold in a report on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Analyst Sebastian Barry-Taylor said the recommendation was based on a year-end target price of $2.44, &quot;which implies upside potential of 24.5 percent.&quot;  </p>
<p>Barry-Taylor noted Autrey's diversified distribution and potential for expansion in its core business.</p>
<p>&quot;ATY has a healthy balance sheet, no debt, high return on equity and a reasonable dividend payout,&quot; the report added.</p>
<p>((--Martin Roberts, Mexico City newsroom +525 728-7907))</p>
</text>
